  «type: X»
  «description: (PLECS) White Noise»
  «library file: |.subckt White-Noise out\nV1 sawtooth 0 pulse 0 1 0 0.99*Ts 0.01*Ts 0 Ts\nB1 latch 0 V=V(sawtooth)<=0.5 & state(1,V(sawtooth))>0.5\nB2 divider 0 V=pow(10,floor(log10(time)))\nB3 U1 0 V=idt(0,limit(random(1e15*time/V(divider)+seed),1m,0.999),V(latch))\nB4 U2 0 V=idt(0,limit(random(1e15*time/V(divider)+seed+1),1m,0.999),V(latch))\nB5 Z0 0 V=sqrt(-2.0*log(V(U1)))*cos(2.0*3.14159*V(U2))\nB6 out 0 V=mu + sigma * V(Z0)\n.ends White-Noise»
